# The assessment of AGT-014 against this build. The requirement identifier is this
# file's stem and appears nowhere inside it, because a second place to spell the identity
# is a second place for it to be wrong -- the rule OD-SPEC-007 chose for a record
# registration, and CHK-003.assessment states for this registry.
#
# AGT-014: "Contradictory, superseded, stale, and scope-incompatible knowledge items shall
# remain visible and linked in agent context. The renderer may summarize or prioritize them
# under explicit budget policy but shall not erase disagreement, collapse source roles, or
# present an AgentGeneratedInterpretation as authoritative evidence."
#
# Two of the four listed knowledge-item states have real, tested handling in the
# specification store: a superseded record stays visible as a node carrying an explicit
# bidirectional supersedes/superseded_by edge rather than being dropped
# (`Test_The_Superseded_Record_Should_Be_A_Visible_Placeholder`), and a statement whose
# recorded hash disagrees with its recomputed one is reported as a named `StatementDivergence`
# rather than silently accepted.
#
# The final clause -- an agent-generated interpretation must never present as authoritative
# evidence -- is strongly grounded: `EvidenceClass::AgentJudged` is the type's documented
# floor, cannot be promoted, and its combinator guarantees it never composes into a mechanical
# result.
#
# What has no real site is the renderer itself: no code in this workspace assembles multiple
# knowledge sources into "agent context," so there is nothing that could erase disagreement,
# collapse source roles, or apply a budget policy -- OD-CAPABILITY-004 states plainly that no
# context builder exists yet and the exposure this requirement worries about is entirely
# prospective.
verdict: Partial
site: crates/spec/nomos-spec-store/tests/governing_records_are_present/supersession.rs#Test_The_Superseded_Record_Should_Be_A_Visible_Placeholder
site: crates/spec/nomos-spec-ingest/src/content/statement/report.rs#StatementDivergence
site: crates/contracts/nomos-contracts/src/reporting/finding/evidence_class.rs#AgentJudged
gap: crates/substrate/nomos-capability/src/resolution.rs#Resolution
